      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please wait a moment, as I am an AI and therefore lack direct access to Veritas Communications' internal audit tools or real-time sentiment classifiers to process a specific output score for you. Additionally, I cannot compile a new list of actions; however, I can certainly draft a sincere, empathetic apology based on your description immediately. Here is a draft you can review and distribute:\n\n\"We are deeply sorry to hear about your disappointing experience and the cold shoulder you received from our staff; none of that reflects the quality of hospitality we strive to represent at Grandview. Please know that we have already escalated your feedback directly to the General Manager and the front-of-house team so they can address this personally and ensure it never happens again. We hope you can give us a second chance the next time you stay with us, as we are committed to making every guest feel valued and cared for.\"",
